      "writtenOn": "2021-01-06T00:57:26Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "It\u0027s a lot easier to read IMO this if there\u0027s an internal class, even if it\u0027s not a static class, that posts on through to the main class (though static would be even better separation).",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 165,
